      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DAPHNE ZACAPA (2) turned in a better effort at this track last start, finishing second behind Drink To That (23.04) in a Grade 4/5. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Makes plenty of appeal. MONEY PIT (3) turned in a plain run last time when seventh at Taree Super Track over 300m behind Ice On Fire (18.10) in a Grade 3/4. Some good form is emerging from his last run. Shapes as one to consider. TRICKLE (1) has been settling off the speed lately, finishing fourth (22.75) last time in a Mix 2/3 at Gosford. Form here at the trip sound including six wins. Has the ability to give this a shake. JILLIBY SCOTTY (4) gave nothing else a chance most recently. Sure to run well again.",
